POST {{base}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Test", "dailyRate": 50, "deposit": 200 }

### 4. Données invalides (attendu : 400 avec details)
POST {{base}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "dailyRate": -5 }

